			"Message": "build(Worker): Minify ESBuild configuration files\n\nThe ESBuild configuration files Target.js and Worker.js in Configuration/ESBuild have been minified, reducing them from 24 and 54 lines respectively to single-line minified output with shortened variable names.\n\nThis optimizes the build configuration files for the Worker component by reducing file size while preserving all functionality including the development mode detection, clean task handling, and build output settings.\n\nRefs: cc40eef78fd7d549e0db557fdfbdb91739176083",
